/ 2px ruby bar at the top of a long read (handoff §9a). Rendered on case pages and journal
/ posts, nowhere else — a progress bar on a page that fits on one screen is noise.
.rc-progress[role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0"
             aria-label=t('global.reading_progress') data-controller="reading-progress"]
